# sweep: --bare
# A solo round narrowed to one difficulty and one category, played to the
# results: a wrong answer, a right one, the round surviving a restart, the
# asides that return to it, a refused scorecard and Play again.
wait-for Play solo
expect 0 rounds played
tap Play solo
expect Solo round
expect 414 questions match
tap Hard
expect 138 questions match
# The categories run onto a second page; the last one is found by turning.
tap-paged Sport & Games
expect 23 questions match
clean
shot solo-setup-filtered
tap Start round
expect Sport & Games · Question 1 of 10
expect What is the maximum break in snooker
clean
shot solo-question
# A wrong answer says so and still marks the right one.
tap 120
expect Not this time
expect Your answer
expect Right answer
expect 0 of 1
clean
shot solo-wrong
tap Next question
expect Question 2 of 10
tap Judo
expect Correct
expect Right answer · Your answer
expect 1 of 2
tap Next question
expect Question 3 of 10
# The round is saved as it is played, so a restart opens on the same question.
restart
wait-for Question 3 of 10
expect empty hand
expect-missing Play with friends
clean
shot solo-restarted
# Rules and About from the round lead back to it, not to Home.
tap Rules
expect A round is saved if the reader sleeps.
tap Back to the round
expect Question 3 of 10
tap-id game-more
expect New game
tap About the questions
expect opentdb.com
expect Back to the round
clean
shot solo-about-from-round
tap Back to the round
expect Question 3 of 10
# Back mid-round asks before the scores are thrown away.
tap-id 4294967295
expect Leave this round?
expect The scores so far will be lost.
clean
shot solo-leave-prompt
tap Keep playing
expect-missing Leave this round?
expect Question 3 of 10
tap-id answer-1
tap Next question
tap-id answer-1
tap Next question
tap-id answer-1
tap Next question
tap-id answer-1
tap Next question
tap-id answer-1
tap Next question
tap-id answer-1
tap Next question
tap-id answer-1
tap Next question
tap-id answer-1
expect Question 10 of 10
expect See results
tap See results
expect Results
expect Round 1 · 10 questions
expect 5 of 10
expect Save scores
clean
shot solo-results
# A scorecard the reader cannot store is said, with the retry on the banner.
scenario storage-full
tap Save scores
wait-for Scores could not be saved
expect Retry saving
clean
shot solo-scorecard-refused
scenario normal
tap Retry saving
wait-for Saved
expect-missing Scores could not be saved
tap Play again
expect Question 1 of 10
expect-missing snooker
# Play again deals from the same mix. The round above was resumed after a
# restart, and the mix it was dealt from has to survive that too.
expect Sport & Games · Question 1 of 10
tap-id 4294967295
tap Leave round
expect Ready when you are
expect 1 round played
